SUMMARY:Leadership on Tap
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n## This is capacity training\, not treatme
 nt. **Nothing is being fixed.**\n\n**New capacity is being built. It is no
 t biofeedback as it has existed before.**\n\n#### Traditional biofeedback 
 shows you numbers.\n\n#### **XRegulation is the first instrument that allo
 ws the nervous system to observe itself directly.**\n\n#### Not as data.\n
 \n#### As experience.\n\n#### **A new category of human technology has eme
 rged.**\n\n### Every pattern your nervous system runs made sense at one po
 int in time. None of it needs to be fought. What changes when the system c
 an finally see itself — clearly\, in real time\, without judgment — is
  not a performance improvement.\n\n### **It is a different relationship wi
 th being alive.**\n\n*LOCATION Change - Hatch CoWorking*\nWho's welcome?\n
 \nEveryone! Whether you're leading in for-profit\, non-profit\, academia\,
  community organizations\, or entrepreneurship – or simply curious about
  leadership – you're welcome to join us.\n\n* Hatch Coworking\n* Parking
 : Street parking is free after 6 pm\n* Beverages: Alcoholic and non-alcoho
 lic beverages
